<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak central bank says allots SKK 2 bln in repos.</title>
<headline>Slovak central bank says allots SKK 2 bln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday it had allocated funds totalling two billion crowns at this morning's securities repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The NBS added that the average rate at the tender, its first ever, was 10.53 percent.</p>
